      "assessment": "Complete body read. Label/notes shell explicitly disclaims a complete alpha/Delaunay algorithm. The added in-circle determinant is a genuine translated 3x3 exact polynomial with all i128 operations checked and absolute input coordinates capped at 10000. Sign requires triangle orientation; zero includes degenerate configurations as documented. Unit-square and noncocircular examples test this narrow determinant, not alpha-complex construction. Mutation-accounting prose is not a run receipt.",
