      ],
      "assessment": "Complete body read. Endpoint Hom matrices are embedded faithfully as corners in the direct sum; lift and decode check endpoints, dimensions and positive denominators, and decode rejects nonzero off-corner support. Cochain lift checks carrier equality. The separately fully read private OperatorCarrier bounds eight fibers of dimension at most four, so offset accumulation is bounded by 32. Independent heterogeneous finite control checks roundtrip and off-corner refusal. Inline mutation test only inspects literal Ok and Err values, not this implementation.",
