      "reviewed_lines": [
        [
          1,
          161
        ]
      ],
      "assessment": "Complete body read. Label shell plus exact local integral-lift operation: primality by trial division, edges below p squared, signed coboundary divisible by p, then quotient modulo p. It computes a triangle cochain representative conditional on supplied lift; it does not derive a global Bockstein cohomology class, quotient by coboundaries, or prove lift independence. Checked arithmetic refuses unsupported range. Trial division has no practical work budget for large primes, though finite. Positive and noncocycle tests are narrow meaningful controls.",
