        ]
      ],
      "assessment": "Complete body read. Exhaustive partial matching plus diagonal option correctly covers finite ungraded diagrams of at most eight points, including unequal and equal cardinalities. It silently drops essential bars and ignores dimension labels, so the result concerns a finite ungraded projection. Rational costs become f64 with no rounding interval, underflow check or monitored error tolerance despite the profile comment and exact-matching wording. Reversed intervals are accepted through absolute diagonal cost. Existing tests correctly cover identical, empty and distant-diagonal cases, but omit grading, essential bars and representational extremes.",
