          "assessment": "Complete body read. Edge constructor excludes loops, boundary-use constructor excludes zero coefficients, and face constructor normalizes unique nonempty boundaries. Public/Serde nested fields defeat those local invariants: grammar new checks endpoint/reference membership and top-level IDs but does not rerun the nested checks. Builder tests vertex boundary before exact CochainWindow construction, but raw loop incidence overwrites source=-1 by target=1; duplicate boundary uses overwrite rather than sum, missing mutated endpoints can panic. Integer vertex-boundary accumulation is unchecked i64. AuthorityEffect strings are labels, not authorization. The L4 capacity record and its tests only verify count bounds, not any cell admission, source binding or chain law. No Rust execution."
