      ],
      "assessment": "Complete body read. Explicit nonempty contiguous vertex-domain encoder refuses duplicate/unsorted/empty cells, missing singleton and missing codimension-one faces before calling canonical closure, so it preserves exactly supplied closed cells. The vertex scan is bounded by family cardinality even for huge labels, avoiding the direct simplicial extreme-label path. Decoder returns the simplex set; report separately verifies boundary composition before exact rational ranks. Independent three-vertex family census confirms codimension-one closure entails all nonempty faces. Report on arbitrary deserialized complex remains subject to its own representation invariants. Literal Result tests do not exercise encoder/decoder or backend.",
