      "assessment": "Complete body read. Private F2ChainComplex checks number/shapes of all maps and every consecutive product, and conversion from simplicial matrices checks integrality before mod-two reduction then revalidates. Kernel/image bases, quotient representatives, dimensions/counts, cocycle coordinates and affine coboundary solution sets follow finite linear algebra on this admitted complex. Direct dimension subtraction is justified by verified image-in-kernel conditional on backend correctness. Vector shape and degree gates are explicit. Torsor language is correct for a nonempty affine fiber, but flat-bundle/gauge interpretation requires an external model and gauge action. Literal Result mutation test is not backend/owner coverage; original GF2 dependency is not executed.",
