          "lines": [
            268,
            283
          ]
        }
      ],
      "reason": "Two distinct vertices with one connecting edge and caller components=2 pass every displayed guard and yield E+C-V=1, while independently derived connectivity has one component and b1=0. Checking1<=C<=V and nonnegativity does not bind C to the graph.",
      "control": "RUSTHOMOLOGY-C001",
      "limits": "Independent exact predicate/model control, not executed Rust. A truthful supplied component count restores the standard graph formula."
    },
