          ]
        }
      ],
      "reason": "Only degree and coefficient length are compared. Coordinates1 in basis e and1 in basis2e add as2e-labelled-coordinate units, whereas actual sum is3e. Subtraction has the same missing basis check.",
      "control": "RUSTHOMOLOGY-C002",
      "limits": "Source and independent finite coordinate model; no Rust execution. Callers may impose an additional same-basis precondition."
